  m_text: "Music\r\n\r\n\u201CSins of the Father\u201D\r\nPerformed by Donna Burke\r\nMetal
    Gear Solid V\r\n\r\n\u201CKaer Morhen Theme\u201D\r\nComposed by Miko\u0142ai
    Stroi\u0144ski and Marcin Przyby\u0142owicz\r\nThe Witcher 3: Wild Hunt\r\n\r\n\u201CLetters\u201D
    & \u201CPromise (Pragma Version)\u201D\r\nComposed by Akira Yamaoka\r\nSilent
    Hill 2 Remake\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSpecial Thanks\r\n\r\nAsia Pacific University
    (APU)\r\nInfomax College of IT and Management\r\nRajeev Poudel \u2013 Supervisor\r\nAnup
    Adhikari\n\n\n\n\nCast & Characters\r\n\r\nShiva\r\nShiva Gurung\r\n\r\nThe Witch\r\nAnmol
    Malla\r\n\r\nSir Rex Midi\r\nSanjay Kandel\r\n\r\nKing Manuel Neur of the House
    of Lion\r\nManuel Neur\r\n\r\nAnkit the Goblin\r\nAnkit Acharya\r\n\r\nSanjog
    the Grim Reaper\r\nSanjog Kumar Ranabhat\r\n\r\nSaiyam the Adventurer\r\nSaiyam
    Rana\r\n\r\nLord Gandmaru\r\nBhupendera Gurung\r\n\r\nLady Jiten\r\nJiten Chapagain\r\n\r\nStay
    Humble Slime\r\nDipendra Pun (Bagh)\r\n\r\nDarth Isak, the Rogue Knight\r\nIsak
    Thapa\r\n\r\nRogue Knights\r\nUtsab Tamang\r\n\r\nFlying Eyes\r\nMausham Thapa
    Magar\r\n\r\nSir Anzo, Knight of the House of the Lion\r\nSankalpa Ojha (Ap Anzo)\n\n\n\nDevelopment
    Team\r\n\r\r\nLead Programmer\r\nSatindra Bahadur Khadka\r\n\r\nLevel Designer\r\nSatindra
    Bahadur Khadka\r\n\r\nGameplay Systems Designer\r\nSatindra Bahadur Khadka\r\n\r\nCharacter
    Designer & Writer\r\nSatindra Bahadur Khadka\r\n\r\n\n\n\nQuality Assurance &
    Testing\r\n\r\nShiva Gurung\r\nIsak Thapa\r\nSanjay Kandel\r\r\nAnkit Acharya\r\nSanjog
    Kumar Ranabhat\r\nSaiyam Rana\r\nBhupendera Gurung\r\nJiten Chapagain\r\nDipendra
    Pun (Samir)\r\nAnmol Malla\r\nUtsab Tamang\r\nMausham Thapa Magar\r\nSankalpa
    Ojha (Ap Anzo)\r\nNishan Gurung\r\nSaran Shrestha\r\nPukar Nepali\n\n\n\n\nCreated
    By\r\n\r\nSatindra Bahadur Khadka\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\nThank You For Playing"
